      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 4,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "So you're asking me about those\r\nparts... means you know.\r\nThat I'd been ranging far despite the ban.",
        "Jp" : "俺にあの辺りのことを聞くってことは――\r\n禁止されてるのに俺が遠くまで\r\n足をのばしてたこと、バレてたんだな"
