      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 5,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Ser Arisen, 'tis a shame you came all this way to\r\nask, but I've no special tidings myself.",
        "Jp" : "覚者さん、わざわざ聞きにきてくれた\r\nところ悪いんだけど\r\n俺も特別な情報は持ってないんだ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 544778,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 6,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I daresay those parts have their share of savage\r\nmonsters prowling about — still, merely drawing\r\nnigh won't hex you or bring illness. 'Tis just\r\nthat, and naught more.",
        "Jp" : "あの辺りは確かに凶暴な魔物がうろついてるけど\r\n近寄ったところで呪われたり\r\n病気になったりはしない――ただそれだけだ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 544779,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
