      "GmdIndex" : 10,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Well done, Ser Arisen! I daresay I ne'er imagined\r\nyou'd truly enter the <SPOT 912>\r\nand vanquish fiends...!",
        "Jp" : "お疲れ様、覚者さん！\r\nまさか本当に《<SPOT 912>》に入って\r\n魔族を倒してくるなんて――！"
