      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 12,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I'd have you tell everyone in the\r\nvillage about this, too!\r\nWith strength, any hardship can be overcome— The\r\nruins, too, are naught to fear— Mayhap they'll\r\nfinally realize as much.",
        "Jp" : "そのこともぜひ、村のみんなに話させてくれよ！\r\n力があれば困難にも打ち勝つことができる――\r\n遺跡も恐れることはない――って\r\nやっと気づくんじゃないかな"
      },
